CIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"72\"/>\n<div class=\"text\">\n<div class=\"title\">Official RC Framework</div>\n<div class=\"desc\">Link and configure your remote control and vehicle, open with CyberBrick Apps.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"btn-group\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/2022040-christmas-santa-s-snowcat-cyberbrick-rc#profileId-2179413\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View More</a> <a class=\"download-btn\" href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s2/default/7e9cb6d71e5d4bca928d900e92c741b8/CyberBrick_Snowcat_RC_Framework.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---Important Notices---->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Important Notices</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">To ensure safety, please read and carefully follow the guidelines below. Minors must be under direct adult supervision when using this product.</span></strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Intended Users: </strong>This product is intended for users aged 16 and above. Users under the age of 16 must be under direct adult supervision throughout use.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Firmware Safety: </strong>Please use only official tools for any firmware operations. Flashing with third-party tools is not supported and may cause irreversible damage, which is not covered by warranty.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Operational Safety: </strong>Do not touch the moving tracks or wheels while the device is operating to prevent pinching injuries.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Battery &amp; Charging: </strong>DO NOT use chargers with output higher than 5V or 2A, only the officially designated battery and charger must be used. Avoid exposing the battery to high temperatures or water.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Maintenance &amp; Storage: </strong>Before use, inspect all 3D-printed parts and sand down any sharp edges or burrs if present. Store the model and small parts in a location out of reach of children and pets to prevent choking hazards.</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Our company is not liable for any equipment damage, failure, fire, or other loss caused by non-compliance with the above requirements.</p>\n<p>Please strictly follow the safety instructions for this product.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "Get ready to spread seasonal cheer with this uniquely festive, remote-controlled snowcat. Dressed in festive red and sporting decorative antlers, it’s the perfect addition to your winter celebrations. Perfect for play or display, it’s the ultimate Christmas gift for endless winter fun.\n\nEasily control its movement and front shovel via remote to transport gifts and spread joy. Customizable LED lights add a warm glow, while the durable tracks glide smoothly over snow. We hope this snowcat will accompany you throughout the remaining winter season, have fun!\n\nFind all files and details on its MakerWorld Page.\n\n*For a smooth build, we recommend reviewing the assembly guide first.\n\nWith the innovative CyberBrick Kit, your decorative Snowcat truly comes alive!\n\nYou can use the remote control to perform various actions, transforming the Snowcat into your personal interactive winter journey.\n\nSpacious decorating space: This snowcat is equipped with a massive front blade and a cargo bed, providing ample space for decorating your snowcat.\n\nCustomized decoration parts: The interior layout includes two independent front seats, along with a spacious cabin. You can even 3D-print an adorable toy figure to serve as the driver for your snowcat.\n\nReady for Snow & Gifts: With excellent appearance and power, the snowcat is a perfect companion for winter dioramas or Christmas displays. Carry gifts, decorate your scene, and bring festive stories to life!\n\nOfficial Design: All model designs, software configurations, and installation instructions are provided by the official Bambu Lab team so that you can enjoy a highly satisfactory experience at every step.\n\nSimplified Assembly: The snowcat is assembled from multiple parts, snap-fit parts and minimal screws simplify assembly.\n\nPrinter-Friendly: All components are optimized for easy 3D printing on any Bambu Lab printer without requiring an AMS(except the multi-colored decorative plates located on both sides of the vehicle).\n\nThe Snowcat is designed to work with the CyberBrick Official Remote. Pre-configured settings have been uploaded to MakerWorld for immediate play,\n\nwhile the CyberBrick App allows full customization of controller functions to match your personal preferences.\n\n* Please visit the CyberBrick Official Standard Remote on Makerworld for more details.\n\nExplore the Product Wiki & Documentation Need in-depth assembly guides, troubleshooting, or technical details for this product? Visit our official Wiki to discover comprehensive resources and answers to all your questions. Visit Wiki\n\nExplore the Product Wiki & Documentation Need in-depth assembly guides, troubleshooting, or technical details for this product? Visit our official Wiki to discover comprehensive resources and answers to all your questions.\n\nExplore the Product Wiki & Documentation\n\nNeed in-depth assembly guides, troubleshooting, or technical details for this product? Visit our official Wiki to discover comprehensive resources and answers to all your questions.\n\nVisit Wiki\n\n*The following is the App connection of CyberBrick Official SoccerBot as an example, which is similar to the Snowcat.\n\nTo ensure safety, please read and carefully follow the guidelines below. Minors must be under direct adult supervision when using this product.\n\nIntended Users: This product is intended for users aged 16 and above. Users under the age of 16 must be under direct adult supervision throughout use.\n\nFirmware Safety: Please use only official tools for any firmware operations. Flashing with third-party tools is not supported and may cause irreversible damage, which is not covered by warranty.\n\nOperational Safety: Do not touch the moving tracks or wheels while the device is operating to prevent pinching injuries.\n\nBattery & Charging: DO NOT use chargers with output higher than 5V or 2A, only the officially designated battery and charger must be used. Avoid exposing the battery to high temperatures or water.\n\nMaintenance & Storage: Before use, inspect all 3D-printed parts and sand down any sharp edges or burrs if present. Store the model and small parts in a location out of reach of children and pets to prevent choking hazards.\n\nOur company is not liable for any equipment damage, failure, fire, or other loss caused by non-compliance with the above requirements.\n\nPlease strictly follow the safety instructions for this product.",
